teleport control, but got the ring instead)  cleaned out the castle,
down to level 31. No downstair? No problem, there is a cursed scroll of 
teleportation several levels ago. Down to level 50, after a few combat,
find a small room surround by water. Put on the ring of levitation, dig a
through the wall, and there was an invisible Baalzebub. After destroying
that, found an Amulet of Yendor in the room! Remeber that there was a level
